### 1. Get all journal entries; a fresh start should return []
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/entries
Accept: application/json

### 2. Submit a journal entry; should return 201 and the created entry
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My first journal entry",
  "content": "Today I completed the Lydia and Regan FastAPI demo."
}

### 3. Get all journal entries; should include the entry just submitted
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/entries
Accept: application/json

### 4. Missing content; should return 422
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Example with missing content"
}
